; claude: the spreadsheet's formula language (Formula): arithmetic over
; numbers and cells, SUM and its kin over ranges, parsed by recursive
; descent -- the smallest expression evaluator of the house, and the
; first to know. Used by appkits/sheet (Sheet, the grid that
; recalculates) and so by TinyVisiCalc and TinyExcel.
;
; Pure OCaml, no Playground (languages/README.md). In the package
; tiny_languages, as tiny_languages.formula.
(library
 (name formula)
 (public_name tiny_languages.formula)
 (wrapped false)
)
